1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:53,070
Elders of the Soul Refining Sect,

25
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:55,350
come out and fight me !

26
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:07,790
This...

27
00:02:07,800 --> 00:02:08,630
This is...

28
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:10,230
There are so many souls !

29
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:17,280
Only under the pressure of a Soul Transformation cultivator

30
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:19,750
can my Origin Soul finally recover.

31
00:02:25,720 --> 00:02:28,150
The Soul Formation Elders have emerged !

32
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:29,910
You sure have guts !

33
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:34,030
Scram !

34
00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:39,630
Such an intense Soul Formation killing intent...

35
00:02:40,040 --> 00:02:41,830
Summon the Ancestor.

36
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:43,870
Insolent brat !

37
00:02:52,880 --> 00:02:53,670
Devour !

38
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:12,270
Little friend,

39
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:15,200
this old man has waited a long time for you.

40
00:03:15,440 --> 00:03:17,070
Paying respects to the Ancestor.

41
00:03:18,040 --> 00:03:19,480
He really is Soul Transformation !

42
00:03:20,160 --> 00:03:22,200
The 9 of you can leave.

43
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:27,470
Little friend Ceng Niu,

44
00:03:27,920 --> 00:03:32,270
this old man has waited 2 years for this day.

45
00:03:33,320 --> 00:03:35,110
If even Liu Mei could find me,

46
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:38,710
it isn't strange for the Soul Refining Sect's Ancestor

47
00:03:39,440 --> 00:03:41,070
to know who I am.

48
00:03:41,480 --> 00:03:43,430
I've been watching you lately,

49
00:03:43,440 --> 00:03:46,590
you've been having a hard time.

50
00:03:50,880 --> 00:03:52,990
For our meeting today,

51
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:55,630
I’ll first give you a small gift.

52
00:03:56,720 --> 00:04:00,230
We’ll discuss details later.

53
00:04:01,640 --> 00:04:03,430
Junior Liu Mei,

54
00:04:03,480 --> 00:04:07,390
you have 10 breaths to get out of my Soul Refining Sect !

55
00:04:07,600 --> 00:04:08,990
If you don't,

56
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:11,990
even if you’re the Suzaku’s disciple,

57
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:15,590
I’ll still kill you !

58
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:18,030
Scram !

59
00:04:18,240 --> 00:04:19,110
Senior,

60
00:04:19,520 --> 00:04:21,230
Junior has orders from my master

61
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:23,830
and I didn’t harm the Soul Refining Sect...

62
00:04:24,840 --> 00:04:26,470
Why are you acting like this ?

63
00:04:26,840 --> 00:04:28,390
6 breaths !

64
00:04:30,870 --> 00:04:32,420
if Junior just leaves like this

65
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:34,190
and my master asks what happened,

66
00:04:34,320 --> 00:04:36,510
I’ll have to tell him of this matter.

67
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:39,830
If he were to get angry...

68
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:41,390
4 breaths !

69
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:45,790
This is...

70
00:04:46,320 --> 00:04:47,910
the Billion-Soul Flag !

71
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:53,430
Little friend Ceng Niu,

72
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:57,310
how was that small gift ?

73
00:04:59,640 --> 00:05:01,400
What kind of small gift is this ?

74
00:05:01,440 --> 00:05:03,430
Senior is willing to offend Suzaku.

75
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:06,590
Junior isn't happy but afraid.

76
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:12,110
Zhuque Zi is old,

77
00:05:12,320 --> 00:05:16,430
he can’t make the entire planet listen to him anymore.

78
00:05:16,880 --> 00:05:18,110
What does Senior want ?

79
00:05:18,640 --> 00:05:19,710
You can just tell me.

80
00:05:20,280 --> 00:05:21,230
Not so fast,

81
00:05:21,640 --> 00:05:25,110
that was only the first gift.

82
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:32,110
Ceng Niu, you sought me out

83
00:05:32,440 --> 00:05:35,110
to use the pressure of my cultivation

84
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:37,230
to heal your Origin Soul.

85
00:05:37,840 --> 00:05:41,590
I will now grant that wish !

86
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:52,270
Is this enough ?

87
00:05:54,880 --> 00:05:55,790
Not enough !

88
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:18,350
And now ?

89
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:20,950
Still not enough !

90
00:06:22,280 --> 00:06:23,510
Alright,

91
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:26,990
it has been over 200 years

92
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:30,070
since this old man last used celestial spiritual energy.

93
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:36,270
I'm spending a lot

94
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:39,390
on this second gift !

95
00:06:58,520 --> 00:06:59,870
Good !

96
00:07:00,400 --> 00:07:03,520
Your cultivation was restored to Middle stage Soul Formation

97
00:07:03,520 --> 00:07:05,720
and is even stronger than before.

98
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:15,630
Thank you, Senior.

99
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:21,190
It's a bit too early to be thanking me,

100
00:07:21,200 --> 00:07:24,390
this old man has a third gift for you.

101
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:26,950
Do you dare to receive it ?

102
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:28,910
Why wouldn’t I ?

103
00:07:30,840 --> 00:07:32,150
Sit down cross-legged.

104
00:07:37,640 --> 00:07:41,590
This is the Soul Refining Sect’s main artifact: the Billion-Soul Flag.

105
00:07:44,440 --> 00:07:46,030
With this artifact,

106
00:07:46,480 --> 00:07:50,470
I even dare to fight against Ascendant cultivators !

107
00:07:51,080 --> 00:07:52,230
Now,

108
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:55,150
I’ll use its soul power

109
00:07:55,680 --> 00:07:59,230
to raise your cultivation to Late stage Soul Formation !

110
00:08:00,400 --> 00:08:01,990
As for your domain,

111
00:08:02,320 --> 00:08:05,230
you must comprehend it yourself.

112
00:08:13,280 --> 00:08:14,470
These souls

113
00:08:15,200 --> 00:08:17,230
are all at Soul Transformation level !

114
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:22,630
When they were about to die,

115
00:08:22,640 --> 00:08:26,590
every Soul Transformation Ancestor of our sect

116
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:31,790
gave up their body to become a soul fragment of the Billion-Soul Flag.

117
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:36,670
You have to remember that when I die,

118
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:42,790
you must add my soul fragment into the flag as well…

119
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:47,670
Absorb as much as you can,

120
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:50,150
this old man isn’t stingy.

121
00:08:50,560 --> 00:08:51,310
Soul power,

122
00:08:52,160 --> 00:08:53,190
unleash !

123
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:21,150
Not bad,

124
00:09:21,640 --> 00:09:24,230
although your domain remains at Middle stage Soul Formation,

125
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:27,950
your spiritual energy has reached Late stage.

126
00:09:26,800 --> 00:09:28,880
Wang Lin's avatar
Late stage Soul Formation

127
00:09:29,800 --> 00:09:31,150
Little friend Ceng Niu,

128
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:35,310
have you absorbed enough from this third gift ?

129
00:09:38,880 --> 00:09:42,390
Senior, you said I can absorb as much as I want ?

130
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:46,190
Of course.

131
00:09:49,120 --> 00:09:53,310
This little guy's body is already full of spiritual energy.

132
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:55,750
Even if he wants to absorb more,

133
00:09:55,760 --> 00:09:57,750
he shouldn't be able to...

134
00:09:59,120 --> 00:10:01,830
Original body, let us both absorb !

135
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:05,670
The original body walks the path of the Ancient Gods,

136
00:10:06,680 --> 00:10:08,960
which survived by devouring spiritual energy.

137
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:10,990
Its need for spiritual energy

138
00:10:11,760 --> 00:10:13,710
is several times greater than the avatar's...

139
00:10:20,520 --> 00:10:23,190
He is back to absorbing energy now !?

140
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:26,790
But it seemed like he couldn't absorb anymore...

141
00:10:35,920 --> 00:10:37,310
Well, well,

142
00:10:37,400 --> 00:10:39,830
I made a promise...

143
00:11:21,080 --> 00:11:22,790
Little friend Ceng Niu,

144
00:11:22,800 --> 00:11:24,590
you really didn’t hold back...

145
00:11:25,320 --> 00:11:26,790
Thank you for the 3 gifts Senior.

146
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:28,590
Is there anything

147
00:11:28,800 --> 00:11:29,790
that Senior needs ?

148
00:11:30,040 --> 00:11:31,430
Junior will do his best to fulfill it.

149
00:11:31,640 --> 00:11:32,310
Good.

150
00:11:33,040 --> 00:11:35,030
I'm glad you said that,

151
00:11:35,040 --> 00:11:36,870
it means I did choose the right gifts.

152
00:11:37,880 --> 00:11:38,870
Follow me !

153
00:11:48,200 --> 00:11:51,360
Inside the Blood Ring
Soul Refining Sect

154
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:48,870
Little friend Ceng Niu,

155
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:51,190
the reason I gave you these gifts

156
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:53,310
is very important.

157
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:57,710
If you hadn’t come to my Soul Refining Sect,

158
00:11:58,000 --> 00:12:00,200
I would’ve gone out to search for you.

159
00:12:01,280 --> 00:12:02,510
Junior has heard that

160
00:12:03,160 --> 00:12:05,520
there is a rumor that I killed a Soul Refining Sect Elder.

161
00:12:05,520 --> 00:12:07,680
I assumed Senior was looking for me.

162
00:12:08,040 --> 00:12:10,030
It's just a cover story.

163
00:12:10,720 --> 00:12:12,790
If I were to look for you

164
00:12:12,800 --> 00:12:14,470
for no reason,

165
00:12:14,800 --> 00:12:16,710
it would attract too much attention.

166
00:12:19,280 --> 00:12:21,240
What is it that requires Senior

167
00:12:21,280 --> 00:12:22,590
to be so careful ?

168
00:12:30,320 --> 00:12:31,870
Little friend Ceng Niu,

169
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:36,710
do you know why planet Suzaku

170
00:12:37,200 --> 00:12:40,310
has less that 10 rank 5 cultivation countries ?

171
00:12:42,200 --> 00:12:43,990
Long ago,

172
00:12:44,680 --> 00:12:48,190
Suzaku became a rank 6 cultivation country

173
00:12:49,040 --> 00:12:52,590
and was granted this planet by the Cultivation Alliance.

174
00:12:53,200 --> 00:12:55,510
When they migrated here,

175
00:12:56,200 --> 00:13:00,990
they found the planet was inhabited by powerful natives,

176
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:03,240
the Forsaken Immortal Clan.

177
00:13:04,120 --> 00:13:07,470
What followed was a long and bloody war.

178
00:13:08,200 --> 00:13:11,270
The cultivators won at great cost.

179
00:13:12,280 --> 00:13:13,990
The Billion Soul Flag

180
00:13:14,600 --> 00:13:18,510
was crafted during that war.

181
00:13:20,600 --> 00:13:23,030
The first Suzaku of the country of Suzaku

182
00:13:23,400 --> 00:13:25,430
made Mount Suzaku

183
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:28,670
the central operation center of planet Suzaku.

184
00:13:29,880 --> 00:13:32,080
The 6 major sects of the country of Suzaku

185
00:13:32,120 --> 00:13:35,550
formed the original 6 rank 5 cultivation countries of the planet.

186
00:13:36,320 --> 00:13:39,990
Our Soul Refining Sect was one of the founding countries.

187
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:41,830
After that,

188
00:13:42,400 --> 00:13:45,430
disciples from these sects scattered

189
00:13:46,320 --> 00:13:51,710
and formed numerous cultivation countries across planet Suzaku.

190
00:13:52,600 --> 00:13:54,790
Becoming a rank 6 cultivation country

191
00:13:55,200 --> 00:13:58,630
has been my Sect's dream for generations.

192
00:13:59,840 --> 00:14:01,790
But all these years,

193
00:14:02,200 --> 00:14:05,990
whenever someone was about to reach Ascendant

194
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:10,310
they would be crippled overnight.

195
00:14:10,680 --> 00:14:11,630
Now,

196
00:14:11,830 --> 00:14:17,120
Soul Refining Country

197
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:14,430
we've even lost our country.

198
00:14:15,520 --> 00:14:18,070
and are forced to operate as a sect.

199
00:14:16,600 --> 00:14:18,840
Soul Refining Sect

200
00:14:12,640 --> 00:14:14,880
Country of Pilu

201
00:14:14,440 --> 00:14:18,840
Country of Pilu

202
00:14:12,640 --> 00:14:14,880
Country of Suzaku

203
00:14:14,440 --> 00:14:17,120
Country of Suzaku

204
00:14:16,600 --> 00:14:18,840
Country of Suzaku

205
00:14:20,280 --> 00:14:25,230
This is because all the previous Suzakus

206
00:14:25,680 --> 00:14:28,790
have prevented any rank 5 country

207
00:14:28,800 --> 00:14:30,510
from reaching rank 6

208
00:14:30,520 --> 00:14:33,790
by fear they'd be overthrown

209
00:14:33,800 --> 00:14:36,310
and would lose control of the planet.

210
00:14:37,840 --> 00:14:38,590
But...

211
00:14:39,160 --> 00:14:41,350
Junior is merely a Soul Formation cultivator.

212
00:14:42,400 --> 00:14:45,710
How is any of that related to me ?

213
00:14:47,040 --> 00:14:48,430
It is related to you.

214
00:14:49,320 --> 00:14:52,070
You are one of Yunque Zi's candidates

215
00:14:52,080 --> 00:14:54,550
to become the next Suzaku.

216
00:14:55,920 --> 00:14:57,190
Yunque Zi ?

217
00:15:03,240 --> 00:15:04,190
Him !?

218
00:15:04,640 --> 00:15:08,390
Yunque Zi is Zhuque Zi's Junior Brother.

219
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:10,680
You gave me the gifts

220
00:15:10,680 --> 00:15:11,990
because of him ?

221
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:14,430
Not entirely.

222
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:23,190
Little friend, are you willing to enter my Soul Refining Sect

223
00:15:23,680 --> 00:15:25,990
as my successor ?

224
00:15:27,800 --> 00:15:29,430
So that one day

225
00:15:29,440 --> 00:15:33,270
my Soul Refining Sect can become a rank 6 cultivation country !

226
00:15:35,400 --> 00:15:36,590
Why me ?

227
00:15:38,280 --> 00:15:41,790
Since we've arrived on planet Suzaku

228
00:15:41,800 --> 00:15:43,470
up to this day,

229
00:15:44,520 --> 00:15:47,630
we've produced 36 Soul Transformation cultivators !

230
00:15:48,880 --> 00:15:53,510
All their souls reside in this Soul Flag.

231
00:15:55,480 --> 00:15:59,430
My Senior Brother was the 36th

232
00:16:02,880 --> 00:16:06,310
and I will be the 37th.

233
00:16:07,720 --> 00:16:08,990
Two years ago,

234
00:16:09,520 --> 00:16:13,550
my Senior Brother sacrificed his lifespan to unleash his foresight domain.

235
00:16:14,800 --> 00:16:19,230
He sought a path of survival for our sect

236
00:16:19,280 --> 00:16:22,470
but in the end, he failed.

237
00:16:23,640 --> 00:16:25,830
The moment he died

238
00:16:26,240 --> 00:16:28,990
is the moment you stepped at the door of the sect !

239
00:16:33,080 --> 00:16:34,670
It may be a coincidence.

240
00:16:35,840 --> 00:16:37,150
Or it may not.

241
00:16:37,720 --> 00:16:41,270
But with my lifespan ending, I must gamble

242
00:16:41,760 --> 00:16:44,680
and believe my Senior Brother's domain succeeded

243
00:16:44,680 --> 00:16:46,790
by bringing you to our sect !

244
00:16:54,840 --> 00:16:57,230
Our sect has no worthy successors,

245
00:16:57,560 --> 00:16:59,080
when I die

246
00:16:59,640 --> 00:17:02,790
Suzaku will claim the Billion-Soul Flag.

247
00:17:03,840 --> 00:17:05,270
Without it,

248
00:17:05,800 --> 00:17:08,390
the Soul Refining Sect is doomed.

249
00:17:11,160 --> 00:17:13,430
When my lifespan ends,

250
00:17:13,600 --> 00:17:15,710
this flag will be yours.

251
00:17:16,200 --> 00:17:19,830
Will you fulfill my request ?

252
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:22,680
Raising a country to rank 6

253
00:17:22,720 --> 00:17:24,400
with Junior's cultivation

254
00:17:24,440 --> 00:17:25,790
is nearly impossible.

255
00:17:29,800 --> 00:17:33,470
Success or failure will depend on fate.

256
00:17:34,840 --> 00:17:36,030
Junior will do his best !

257
00:17:39,200 --> 00:17:42,310
I can protect you for 10 years.

258
00:17:42,480 --> 00:17:46,000
After that, you're on your own.

259
00:17:46,400 --> 00:17:49,230
This jade slip contains the Soul Sealing spell

260
00:17:47,880 --> 00:17:50,280
Soul Sealing jade slip

261
00:17:49,800 --> 00:17:52,440
as well as the method to control the Billion-Soul Flag

262
00:17:52,440 --> 00:17:55,470
and the sect's core secrets.

263
00:17:56,480 --> 00:17:57,990
From now on,

264
00:17:58,680 --> 00:18:02,910
you're the only core disciple of the Soul Refining Sect !

265
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:05,870
Thank you Ancestor.

266
00:18:08,240 --> 00:18:10,390
I must enter seclusion

267
00:18:10,520 --> 00:18:15,190
to prepare my soul for the flag before I die.

268
00:18:15,840 --> 00:18:19,040
Don't go farther than 10 000 li of the sect.

269
00:18:15,840 --> 00:18:19,040
Note: 1 li = 500m

270
00:18:20,120 --> 00:18:21,990
If you ever are in danger,

271
00:18:22,240 --> 00:18:24,430
I need to be able to help you in time.

272
00:18:24,880 --> 00:18:25,870
Don't worry Senior,

273
00:18:26,320 --> 00:18:28,110
if I couldn't take care of myself,

274
00:18:28,520 --> 00:18:29,710
I wouldn't have survived this long.

275
00:18:30,200 --> 00:18:31,470
Junior has unfinished business

276
00:18:31,840 --> 00:18:33,230
that needs to be settled.

277
00:18:33,600 --> 00:18:35,660
I'll return to the Soul Refining Sect

278
00:18:35,760 --> 00:18:37,240
before you come out of seclusion.

279
00:18:38,400 --> 00:18:39,790
Since you are sure,

280
00:18:40,400 --> 00:18:42,510
I'll say no more.

281
00:19:15,160 --> 00:19:18,280
Wang Lin's original body
3-stars Ancient God

282
00:20:00,680 --> 00:20:02,430
After absorbing the wood spirit,

283
00:20:03,160 --> 00:20:04,640
the Heaven Defying Bead

284
00:20:04,680 --> 00:20:06,950
only lacks the metal element.

285
00:20:09,200 --> 00:20:11,070
Li Yuanfeng of Xue Yue,

286
00:20:11,320 --> 00:20:12,830
Giant Demon Clan's Ancestor,

287
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:15,510
and Sun Tai, who took the opportunity to seal me.

288
00:20:16,240 --> 00:20:18,590
I need to repay you all

289
00:20:21,400 --> 00:20:23,190
for what you did to me !

290
00:20:30,480 --> 00:20:33,710
Since I fought Sun Tai's lightning,

291
00:20:34,120 --> 00:20:35,870
I've been severely injured.

292
00:20:37,040 --> 00:20:41,430
This is all because of that damned Ceng Niu !

293
00:20:43,880 --> 00:20:46,590
Have you found Ceng Niu's body ?

294
00:20:46,600 --> 00:20:48,230
No trace of it yet...

295
00:20:49,160 --> 00:20:51,430
All of you are useless !

296
00:20:55,480 --> 00:20:57,110
Li Yuanfeng !

297
00:20:58,240 --> 00:20:59,990
Ceng Niu...

298
00:21:09,070 --> 00:23:45,280
“Original body… Let us both absorb!” Wang Lin called out to his original body in his heart.
This call crossed a long distance. At this moment, the original body in Chu opened his eyes.
The two purple stars on the original body began to spin.There was no longer a primary or secondary body between the original and the avatar; both were Wang Lin. It was as if he was split in half. When they fuse, they will become the real Wang Lin.
There was a mysterious connection between the avatar and the original body, which was why the original body was hurt when his Origin Soul collapsed. Through the same mysterious connection, the original body was absorbing spiritual energy from his avatar like crazy.

299
00:21:26,320 --> 00:21:29,620
To let go of the consequences of my actions

300
00:21:29,620 --> 00:21:31,340
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

301
00:21:31,380 --> 00:21:33,280
like scattered ink.

302
00:21:34,160 --> 00:21:40,760
As destiny falls

303
00:21:37,000 --> 00:21:40,760
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

304
00:21:40,760 --> 00:21:48,360
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

305
00:21:44,000 --> 00:21:48,360
wither and melt into rivers.

306
00:21:48,800 --> 00:21:55,920
Who can deceive

307
00:21:51,560 --> 00:21:55,920
the law of the heavens ?

308
00:21:56,240 --> 00:21:59,240
Countless generations

309
00:21:57,520 --> 00:21:59,240
have tried before me.

310
00:21:59,530 --> 00:22:02,960
But how could I not catch my dreams

311
00:22:01,360 --> 00:22:02,960
within my warm fingers ?

312
00:22:03,520 --> 00:22:07,040
You're at my side when I'm alone

313
00:22:07,040 --> 00:22:10,360
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

314
00:22:11,120 --> 00:22:14,320
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

315
00:22:14,680 --> 00:22:18,520
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

316
00:22:16,520 --> 00:22:18,520
in the streets.

317
00:22:18,680 --> 00:22:23,480
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

318
00:22:20,240 --> 00:22:23,480
Can I break the rules ?

319
00:22:23,490 --> 00:22:26,200
To run towards you !

320
00:22:26,240 --> 00:22:29,520
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

321
00:22:29,520 --> 00:22:34,160
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

322
00:22:34,160 --> 00:22:37,560
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

323
00:22:37,600 --> 00:22:42,240
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

324
00:22:42,690 --> 00:22:47,920
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

325
00:22:48,040 --> 00:22:51,840
If your soul is willing to wander,

326
00:22:51,840 --> 00:22:56,480
can I still take your hands

327
00:22:53,520 --> 00:22:56,480
and hold them tight ?

328
00:22:56,640 --> 00:22:59,560
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

329
00:22:59,560 --> 00:23:04,440
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

330
00:23:04,450 --> 00:23:07,720
I dream of destroying

331
00:23:07,880 --> 00:23:12,440
the shackles of our fate.

332
00:23:12,440 --> 00:23:16,400
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

333
00:23:16,400 --> 00:23:19,200
You're the hardest to let go of.

334
00:23:19,280 --> 00:23:23,080
I want to be with you again

335
00:23:23,160 --> 00:23:26,440
so I can look in your eyes.

336
00:23:26,720 --> 00:23:31,680
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
